<title>SWITZERLAND: Immuno 1996 profit drops.</title>
<headline>Immuno 1996 profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>ZOLLIKON, Switzerland 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			7		   vs 31</p>
<p> Div (share)		    0		   vs 20 pct</p>
<p> Turnover			 670		 vs 626</p>
<p>NOTE - Immuno International AG has been acquired by Baxter International Inc and has only around 5,000 bearer shares outstanding.</p>
<p>It said the decline in net profit primarily reflected restructuring costs and reserves of 54 million francs.</p>
<p>&quot;Without these, results would clearly have risen compared with the previous year,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
